                                "sense_id": "611b39ce-1dc6-30f9-80cb-79fa37dcaadc",
                                "text": "Both edges of the crosshead are thus marked, the short centre lines being easily scratched with a scriber as soon as the arcs are made with a calliper, in fact, a mere dot with a dotter is sufficient."
